- Default: `{{ .agents.pi.defaults.provider }}/{{ .agents.pi.defaults.model }}`, {{ .agents.pi.defaults.reasoning_effort }} reasoning; planning uses {{ .agents.pi.defaults.plan_reasoning_effort }}.
- The approval classifier (MCP calls, remote-mutating shell verbs and unsandboxed
